       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI56302.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI56302.
      *
      *     Anulação de reconciliação
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI56302         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5630.
       COPY SWCV5631.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY AQCW0005.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5808 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 FILLER                       PIC  X(01) VALUE SPACES.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI56302'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI56302         '.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.

           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA'  TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5630-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5630-ASE               TO SWCV5631-ASE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA'    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5630-ADE               TO SWCV5631-ADE.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-OBTEM-DADOS
                 THRU 2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-OBTEM-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-OBTEM-DADOS.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5630-COSN              TO SWCD5808-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV5630-COSNC             TO SWCD5808-COSNC.
           MOVE SWCV5630-IDRECON           TO SWCD5808-IDRECONC.

           EXEC SQL
              SELECT CCODMSG
                   , DATVAL
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , CREF
                   , CREFOPR
                   , CREFEXT
                   , CSEND
                   , CBAN
                   , CSPAI
                   , CCODEST
                   , CTIPOP
                   , MVALOR
                   , CMOED
                   , DATREC
                   , CTIPREC
                   , CTRATRYP
                   , CCODOPE
                   , CDBCR
                   , DREG
                   , NOPRREC
                   , MOTIVO
      *            , OBSER
                   , GDESC
                   , CBYPASS
                   , CSENDREC
                   , MVLRREC
                   , CMOEDREC
                   , CROPRREC
                   , CORIGEMREC
                   , CNIVREC
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   , CEXT
                   , CPAG
                   , NORDREC
                INTO :SWCD5808-CCODMSG
                   , :SWCD5808-DATVAL
                   , :SWCD5808-COSN
                   , :SWCD5808-COSNC
                   , :SWCD5808-CREF
                   , :SWCD5808-CREFOPR
                   , :SWCD5808-CREFEXT
                   , :SWCD5808-CSEND
                   , :SWCD5808-CBAN
                   , :SWCD5808-CSPAI
                   , :SWCD5808-CCODEST
                   , :SWCD5808-CTIPOP
                   , :SWCD5808-MVALOR
                   , :SWCD5808-CMOED
                   , :SWCD5808-DATREC
                   , :SWCD5808-CTIPREC
                   , :SWCD5808-CTRATRYP
                   , :SWCD5808-CCODOPE
                   , :SWCD5808-CDBCR
                   , :SWCD5808-DREG
                   , :SWCD5808-NOPRREC
                   , :SWCD5808-MOTIVO
      *            , :SWCD5808-OBSER
                   , :SWCD5808-GDESC
                   , :SWCD5808-CBYPASS
                   , :SWCD5808-CSENDREC
                   , :SWCD5808-MVLRREC
                   , :SWCD5808-CMOEDREC
                   , :SWCD5808-CROPRREC
                   , :SWCD5808-CORIGEMREC
                   , :SWCD5808-CNIVREC
                   , :SWCD5808-CUSERID
                   , :SWCD5808-HTIMEST
                   , :SWCD5808-CEXT
                   , :SWCD5808-CPAG
                   , :SWCD5808-NORDREC
                FROM SWVT5808
               WHERE COSN      =  :SWCD5808-COSN
                 AND COSNC     =  :SWCD5808-COSNC
                 AND IDRECONC  =  :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 IF VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-DATVAL-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-DATVAL-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-DATVAL-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-DATVAL-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-COSN-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSN-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-COSN-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-COSN-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-COSNC-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSNC-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-COSNC-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-COSNC-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-CREF-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CREF-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-CREF-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-CREF-CAPLIC
                 ELSE
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CCODMSG  TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG
                    MOVE SWCD5808-DATVAL   TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5631-DATVAL
                    MOVE SWCD5808-COSN     TO SWCV5631-COSN
                    MOVE SWCD5808-COSNC    TO SWCV5631-COSNC
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CREF     TO SWCV5631-CREF
                    MOVE SWCD5808-IDRECONC TO SWCV5631-IDRECON
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CREFOPR  TO SWCV5631-CREFOPR
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CREFEXT  TO SWCV5631-CREFEXT
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CSEND    TO SWCV5631-CSEND
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CCODEST  TO SWCV5631-CCODEST
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CTIPOP   TO SWCV5631-CTIPOP
                    MOVE SWCD5808-MVALOR   TO SWCV5631-MVALOR
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CMOED    TO SWCV5631-CMOED
                    MOVE SWCD5808-DATREC   TO SWCV5631-DATREC
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CTIPREC  TO SWCV5631-CTIPREC
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CTRATRYP TO SWCV5631-CTRATRYP
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CCODOPE  TO SWCV5631-CCODOPE
                    MOVE SWCD5808-CDBCR    TO SWCV5631-CDBCR
                    MOVE SWCD5808-DREG     TO SWCV5631-DREG
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5631-MRDATLX
                    MOVE SWCD5808-NOPRREC  TO SWCV5631-MRNOPRX
                    MOVE SWCD5808-NORDREC  TO SWCV5631-MRNORDX
      *             MOVE SWCD5808-OBSER    TO SWCV5631-OBSER

      *             IF SWCD5808-NOPRREC EQUAL ZEROES
      *                MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
      *                  TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
      *                MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
      *                  TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-S
      *                MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-N-EXISTS
      *                  TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-MSG
      *                MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
      *                  TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
      *             END-IF

                    IF NOT VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                        CONTINUE
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 IF NOT VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-DATVAL-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-DATVAL-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-DATVAL-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-DATVAL-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-COSN-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSN-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-COSN-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-COSN-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-COSNC-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSNC-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-COSNC-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-COSNC-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5631-CREF-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5631-CREF-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5631-CREF-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5631-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5631-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5631-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY AQCP0005.
